 "result": "I documented 12 repos this run. They are the four new backfills (pajamastan-card-orders, 2026-11-24-blue-estate-dossier, starwake-game and 2026-11-24-green-filecensus) and eight updates.\n\nThe updates were conveyor-sim, explode, pdf-yourself, field-twin-viridian, hire-portal, strudel-samples, hush and the agent test bed. Each got one commit with the changelog and README, plus a release job in publish.json. Strudel-samples needed no change because its entry was already correct. I also pushed the refreshed profile to the sudosilo repo and committed the scribe state to control-troll.\n\nThe backfill queue is now empty apart from control-troll, heckle-troll and sudosilo, which are skipped on purpose. Eight repos with new commits were left for the next run because of the cap of 12. They are field-twin, the hubview repo, mohavetech-website, datacenter-osint, topo-wars-server, pajamastan-warrants and the two signal-snapshot repos. The packets repo, itchy-troll and blue-agent only had scribe or bot commits, so I just refreshed their state.\n\nI could reach every repo. One push to the FileCensus repo was rejected because the phone pushed a new commit meanwhile. I rebased, added the safe delete change to its entry, and pushed again. I did not condense agents/notes/general.md, which is now over 109 lines and past the 40 line limit, so it needs condensing soon.",
